+  `bibtex tautA-codex-01`,
+  `pdflatex -interaction=nonstopmode tautA-codex-01.tex`,
+  `pdflatex -interaction=nonstopmode tautA-codex-01.tex`.
+- Final log status: no unresolved references or undefined citations found.  The log reports only overfull hbox warnings.
